From f7a1fceaa396d4562b1498c2fa2577c8af3e84f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rasheed <arasheedu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:15:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] build: keep llama.cpp carry patches LF on checkout

With core.autocrlf on Windows the compat patches were checked out with
CRLF line endings and git apply rejected them at configure time.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitattributes | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitattributes b/.gitattributes
index ff7972b6..184ea630 100644
--- a/.gitattributes
+++ b/.gitattributes
@@ -13,3 +13,6 @@ llama/build-info.cpp linguist-generated
 
 * text=auto
 *.go text eol=lf
+
+# llama.cpp carry patches must stay LF, or git apply rejects them at configure time
+*.patch text eol=lf
-- 
2.47.1.windows.2

